  "nameOrigin": "From Rhenus, the Latin name of the Rhine.",
  "source": "pubchem",
  "note": "Detected by X-ray spectroscopy in platinum ores and columbite; in 1928 about 1 g was won from some 660 kg of molybdenite (Jefferson Lab names Noddack and Berg for this step).",
